":1424628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjQ2Mjg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1424628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Michael0x2a","html_url":"https://github.com/Michael0x2a","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Michael0x2a/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Michael0x2a/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Michael0x2a/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Michael0x2a/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Michael0x2a/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Michael0x2a/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Michael0x2a/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Michael0x2a/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Michael0x2a/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-11-04T16:42:11Z","updated_at":"2019-11-04T16:42:11Z","body":"@TH3CHARLie -- sure. \r\n\r\nThe change you're trying to make is to return a new callback in the `get_method_hooks` method here: https://github.com/python/mypy/blob/master/mypy/plugins/default.py#L52.\r\n\r\nI recommend skimming through some of the existing method hook callbacks to get a feel for how they work, but on a high level what you'll want to do is to modify the return type if the underlying object is:\r\n\r\n1. An [`Instance` object](https://github.com/python/mypy/blob/master/mypy/types.py#L690) where the `last_known_value` field is set to an int [LiteralType object](https://github.com/python/mypy/blob/master/mypy/types.py#L1538).\r\n2. An int LiteralType object.\r\n\r\nIt doesn't matter too much where you add test cases for this, but probably https://github.com/python/mypy/blob/master/test-data/unit/check-literal.test is a reasonable home for them. The [Tests README](https://github.com/python/mypy/blob/master/test-data/unit/README.md) has more info on writing/running test cases.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/comments/549440897/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Michael0x2a","id":1424628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjQ2Mjg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1424628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Michael0x2a","html_url":"https://github.com/Michael0x2a","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Michael0x2a/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Michael0x2a/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Michael0x2a/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Michael0x2a/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Michael0x2a/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Michael0x2a/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Michael0x2a/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Michael0x2a/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Michael0x2a/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":2768407868,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50Mjc2ODQwNzg2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/events/2768407868","actor":{"login":"TH3CHARLie","id":22651013,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNjUxMDEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22651013?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TH3CHARLie","html_url":"https://github.com/TH3CHARLie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TH3CHARLie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TH3CHARLie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TH3CHARLie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TH3CHARLie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":